---
// Inline SVG icons (Lucide-style strokes). The web fonts have no arrow glyphs (U+2190 and friends), so arrows
// are drawn, not typed. Decorative: the link or button around the icon carries the accessible name.
// `mywed` is the exception: MyWed's official symbol (hexagon mark from https://mywed.com/en/logotypes/, wordmark
// removed), a filled single-colour shape that inherits currentColor. Used only to link to the photographer's MyWed profile.
